  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Road Development and Maintenance Project (Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide paved road connections incorporating climate adaptation and mitigation principles to ensure all-weather access between aimag capitals in Western Mongolia: Altai, Gobi-Altai to Uliastai, Zavkhan and Khovd, Khovd to Ulaangom, Uvs.</narrative>
  </description>
